{
  "//": "agent-pi 的类型检查。它此前**完全没有**类型检查（Node 的类型剥离只剥不查），于是生成类型在这边等于没有约束。⚠️ 用移动端那份 typescript/@types/node：本仓库不在 agent-pi 里重复装一套（那里只装 pi SDK）。",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2023",
    "lib": ["ES2023"],
    "module": "NodeNext",
    "moduleResolution": "NodeNext",
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "strict": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "typeRoots": ["../mobile/node_modules/@types"],
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts"]
}
